\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Can it handle strong accents or fast speakers?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 Yes. Whisper\'92s technology is known for robustness across accents and speaking styles.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Can I transcribe videos?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 Yes. Simply upload the video file\'97audio will be extracted automatically.\
